<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to Sept 4, of shipments (1995/96 except for sunseed), export commitments (1995/96) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  3,625.3  4,100.0   Dec-Nov	4,519.3    449.1</p>
<p> Maize	  5,764.5  5,900.0   Mar-Feb	5,939.9    138.1</p>
<p> Sorghum	  624.8    650.0   Mar-Feb	  613.5	5.0</p>
<p> Soybeans     1,799.1  2,100.0   Apr-Mar	2,192.5    146.5</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 534.3    600.0   Jan-Dec	  571.3	5.7</p>
